<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>每日情報 — {{ date }}</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@400;500;600;700;900&family=Source+Serif+4:ital,opsz,wght@0,8..60,400;0,8..60,600;1,8..60,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper: #F3EEE1; --paper-dark: #EAE3D0; --ink: #201D18; --ink-soft: #4A453C;
    --rule: #C9BFA5; --accent: #7A2A28; --accent-soft: #9C6B4E;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{ margin:0; background: var(--paper-dark); color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; }
  .sheet{ max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; background: var(--paper);
    padding: 40px 48px 60px; box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }

  .masthead{ text-align:center; padding-bottom: 18px; }
  .masthead .eyebrow-line{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color: var(--ink-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .masthead h1{ font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif; font-weight:900; font-size: 54px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em; margin: 4px 0 6px; line-height:1; }
  .masthead .subtitle{ font-style: italic; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .masthead .rules{ border: none; border-top: 3px solid var(--ink); margin: 0 0 3px; }
  .masthead .rules.thin{ border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0; }

  .brief-box{ margin: 26px 0 34px; padding: 20px 24px;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); background: var(--paper-dark); }
  .brief-box .label{ font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif; font-weight:700; font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .brief-box p{ font-size: 17px; line-height:1.75; margin:0; }
  .brief-box p::first-letter{ font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif; font-weight:900; font-size: 46px;
    float:left; line-height:0.8; padding-right:8px; padding-top:4px; color: var(--accent); }

  .frontpage-label{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .frontpage-label h2{ font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif; font-weight:900; font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing:0.1em; margin:0; color: var(--ink); }
  .frontpage-label .line{ flex:1; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .frontpage-label .sub{ font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap; }

  .top3-block{ padding-bottom: 24px; margin-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .top3-block:last-of-type{ border-bottom: 3px double var(--ink); margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .pill-tag{ display:inline-block; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.02em;
    color:#fff; background: var(--accent-soft); border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .top3-block h2{ font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif; font-weight:700; font-size: 24px; line-height:1.3; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .top3-block .score{ display:inline-block; font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft);
    border:1px solid var(--rule); padding:2px 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .top3-block p{ font-size:15px; line-height:1.75; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .top3-block .why-me{ font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; padding-left:14px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-soft); color: var(--ink); margin-bottom:12px; }
  .top3-block .why-me b{ color:var(--accent); font-style:normal; }
  .top3-block .extra b{ font-weight:600; color: var(--accent); }
  .top3-block .keywords, .top3-block .sources-line{ font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:6px; }

  .body-label{ text-align:center; margin: 6px 0 30px; }
  .body-label span{ font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.2em; color:var(--ink-soft);
    border-top:1px solid var(--rule); border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule); padding: 4px 0; display:block; }

  .category-block{ margin-bottom: 46px; }
  .section-head{ background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); padding: 11px 18px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .section-head h2{ font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif; font-weight:700; font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin:0; }

  .article-columns{ column-count: 2; column-gap: 34px; column-rule: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .article{ break-inside: avoid; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .article summary{ list-style:none; cursor:pointer; position:relative; padding-right:22px; }
  .article summary::-webkit-details-marker{ display:none; }
  .article summary::after{ content:"展開 ＋"; position:absolute; right:0; top:2px;
    font-size:11px; color:var(--accent); white-space:nowrap; }
  .article[open] summary::after{ content:"收合 －"; }
  .article h3{ font-family:'Noto Serif TC', serif; font-weight:700; font-size: 16px; line-height:1.35; margin: 0 22px 5px 0; }
  .article .meta{ font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 7px; }
  .article summary p{ font-size: 13.5px; line-height:1.6; margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .article .expand-body{ margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--rule); }
  .article .expand-body p{ font-size: 13.5px; line-height:1.65; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .article .expand-body b{ color: var(--accent); font-weight:600; }
  .article .keywords{ font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:6px; }

  .colophon{ margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  @media (max-width: 720px){
    .sheet{ padding: 26px 20px 40px; } .masthead h1{ font-size: 38px; }
    .article-columns{ column-count:1; } .colophon{ flex-direction:column; gap:4px; }
    .frontpage-label .sub{ display:none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet">

  <div class="masthead">
    <div class="eyebrow-line">
      <span>第 {{ "%03d"|format(issue_number) }} 期</span>
      <span>PERSONAL DAILY INTELLIGENCE(每日情報)</span>
      <span>{{ date_display }}</span>
    </div>
    <h1>每日情報</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">{% if total_collected %}今天分析 {{ total_collected }} 則資訊，{% endif %}篩出 {{ items|length }} 則值得你注意 · 預估閱讀時間 {{ reading_minutes }} 分鐘</div>
    <hr class="rules"><hr class="rules thin">
  </div>

  <div class="brief-box">
    <div class="label">今日三十秒</div>
    <p>{{ today_in_30_seconds }}</p>
  </div>

  {% if top3_items %}
  <div class="frontpage-label">
    <h2>頭版精選</h2>
    <div class="line"></div>
    <span class="sub">跨類別綜合評選，不重複出現於下方分類區塊</span>
  </div>

  {% for item in top3_items %}
  <div class="top3-block">
    <span class="pill-tag">{{ category_names[item.category] }}</span>
    <h2>{{ item.headline }}</h2>
    <span class="score">重要度 {{ item.importance_score|round|int }} · 相關度 {{ item.personal_relevance_score|round|int }}</span>
    <p>{{ item.what_happened }}</p>
    <p class="why-me"><b>對你來說：</b>{{ item.why_it_matters_to_me }}</p>
    <p class="extra"><b>可能造成的影響：</b>{{ item.potential_impact }}</p>
    <p class="extra"><b>接下來該觀察：</b>{{ item.what_to_watch_next }}</p>
    <div class="keywords">關鍵字：{{ item.keywords|join('、') }}</div>
    <div class="sources-line">來源：{% for s in item.sources|unique(attribute='name') %}{{ translate_source(s.name) }}{% if not loop.last %}、{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
  {% endif %}

  <div class="body-label"><span>以下為今日完整分類報導，不含上方頭版精選 · 點擊標題可展開完整分析</span></div>

  {% for cat_key, cat_items in categories_with_items %}
  {% if cat_items %}
  <div class="category-block">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>{{ category_names[cat_key] }}</h2></div>
    <div class="article-columns">
      {% for item in cat_items %}
      <details class="article">
        <summary>
          <h3>{{ item.headline }}</h3>
          <div class="meta">{% for s in item.sources|unique(attribute='name') %}{{ translate_source(s.name) }}{% if not loop.last %}、{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
          <p>{{ item.one_sentence_summary }}</p>
        </summary>
        <div class="expand-body">
          <p><b>發生什麼事：</b>{{ item.what_happened }}</p>
          {% if '關聯度較低' in item.why_it_matters_to_me %}
          <p>{{ item.why_it_matters_to_me }}</p>
          {% else %}
          <p><b>對你來說：</b>{{ item.why_it_matters_to_me }}</p>
          <p><b>可能造成的影響：</b>{{ item.potential_impact }}</p>
          <p><b>接下來該觀察：</b>{{ item.what_to_watch_next }}</p>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="keywords">關鍵字：{{ item.keywords|join('、') }}</div>
        </div>
      </details>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="colophon">
    <span>每日情報 · 私人情報摘要，不對外公開發布</span>
    <span>由 Gemini 分析生成 · 內容僅供參考</span>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
